title: Fixed the 3 convene-surfaced defects (double-tilde aspect, f:N collision, warpline security)
summary: Implemented and verified all three defects the self-study convene surfaced. The double-tilde aspect bug was root-caused beyond the original report (the true source is the symbol builder in premise/core, not just the DB layer) and fixed at the root plus a defensive dedup at the DB layer; the f:N essence-hash collision was fixed with a U+001F-anchored slot token + regression test; the /api/warpline security cluster (arg-injection, portal gates, bind address, lying validator) was fully closed.
